# SkillSphere AI - Environment Variables Configuration

# 1. Google Gemini AI API Key (Optional for Live API; platform includes full realistic simulated fallback)
NEXT_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSyYourGeminiApiKeyHere

# 2. Firebase Configuration (Optional for Live Firebase; platform includes mock local session persistence)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSyYourFirebaseApiKey
